								<p class="newsTitle">
									Runes, loot, and dirt naps! - destiniri - 
									2/28/2005 10:19:07 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									Hi!<br /><img src="/pics/2151/Bone_Cracker.jpeg" /><br /><br />I think I'll kill you all... then a bard will agro me and I'll kill you all after you rezd! (heh... ooops)<br /><br />Well unfortunately this guy is a pain in the ass with is&nbsp;fake death&nbsp;AE and nuke AE... all based on your proximity... PLUS you need to make sure you position him right or he regens faster than me after ice cream. Can't win them all, and this one falls right into that category.<br />We've been gatherig up level 69 runes and some loot, plus trying some new targets. Membership has been growing, so if you are interested it's still open to all classes 60+. We are having a lot of fun, and thats just the start.
								</div>
							</td>
	</tr><tr>
		<td>
								<div class="newsSeperator">&nbsp;</div>
							</td>
	</tr><tr>
		<td class="grid_col2" align="Center">
								<p class="newsTitle">
									Regearing and Raiding begins! - 
									2/23/2005 10:12:43 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<p align="center"><font color="#ffff00" size="6"><strong>Recruiting!</strong></font> <center></center><br /><br /> <p align="left"><font color="#f5f5dc">After a lull in the action Awakened Fires is back on the raid path. Starting small were doing fun things that net us a lot of level 69 runes and some upgrades for a lot of our newer members. PoP elemental backflag targets will also be dropping soon, so we can work on getting everyone flagged up for fire, water, and earth.<br /><br />If you are 60+ (no other requirements), have a good attitude and enjoy working as a team, then we have a spot for you. Simple DKP based loot, fair rune distribution, and a lot of fun is what we can offer. We raid on Sunday and Wednesday, with Tuesday reserved for Epic fight night. We also offer a guild invite, not some PM period where you have to kiss ass 24/7 and hope people dont think you are some social reculse living in a case with DSL. Contact anyone in the guild for our next raid time and place so you can meet up and join the fun.</font></p>
								</div>
							</td>
	</tr><tr>
		<td>
								<div class="newsSeperator">&nbsp;</div>
							</td>
	</tr><tr>
		<td align="Center">
								<p class="newsTitle">
									AWAKENED FIRES APPROVED! - 
									10/19/2004 12:48:23 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<p>Just before shutting off my computer and heading to bed I decided to give my email one last check and guess what I saw!!!<br /><br />Congratulations, your guild Awakened Fires has been approved!<br /><br />I quickly logged back in the the Guild Invite frenzy ensued. </p>
